.TH NOBLE-PDF 1 "October 2026" "Noble PDF Reader 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
noble-pdf, pdfx \- High-performance Terminal & CLI PDF Swiss Army Knife for Linux
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B noble-pdf
[\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fICOMMAND\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBNoble PDF Reader\fR (binary: \fBnoble-pdf\fR, alias: \fBpdfx\fR) is a lightweight, memory-efficient, keyboard-friendly Terminal & CLI application written in modern Rust for Linux.
It provides comprehensive PDF management including merging, splitting, extraction, rotation, page reordering, compression, text extraction, OCR, and an interactive Ratatui TUI viewer.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-d ", " \-\-debug
Enable verbose debug logging.
.TP
.BR \-\-json
Output result in machine-readable JSON format.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print help information.
.TP
.BR \-V ", " \-\-version
Print version information.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B open \fR[\fIFILE\fR]
Launch the interactive Ratatui TUI PDF viewer.
.TP
.B info \fIFILE\fR
Inspect document metadata, version, encryption, page dimensions, and page count.
.TP
.B merge \fIFILE1\fR \fIFILE2\fR... \fB\-o\fR \fIOUTPUT\fR
Merge multiple PDF files into a single document atomically.
.TP
.B split \fIFILE\fR \fB\-p\fR \fIPAGES\fR [\fB\-o\fR \fIDIR\fR]
Split a PDF into separate files by page range (e.g. '1-5', '1-2,3-4', 'odd', 'even').
.TP
.B extract \fIFILE\fR \fB\-p\fR \fIPAGES\fR \fB\-o\fR \fIOUTPUT\fR
Extract specific page ranges into a new PDF document.
.TP
.B rotate \fIFILE\fR [\fB\-p\fR \fIPAGES\fR] [\fB\-a\fR \fIDEGREES\fR] \fB\-o\fR \fIOUTPUT\fR
Rotate specified pages clockwise by 90, 180, or 270 degrees.
.TP
.B delete \fIFILE\fR \fB\-p\fR \fIPAGES\fR \fB\-o\fR \fIOUTPUT\fR
Delete specified pages from the PDF document.
.TP
.B reorder \fIFILE\fR \fB\-s\fR \fISEQUENCE\fR \fB\-o\fR \fIOUTPUT\fR
Reorder or duplicate pages based on explicit sequence order.
.TP
.B text \fIFILE\fR [\fB\-p\fR \fIPAGES\fR] [\fB\-o\fR \fIOUTPUT\fR]
Extract plain text from document pages to stdout or an output file.
.TP
.B compress \fIFILE\fR \fB\-o\fR \fIOUTPUT\fR
Optimize and compress PDF content streams, removing duplicate objects.
.TP
.B ocr \fIFILE\fR [\fB\-p\fR \fIPAGES\fR] [\fB\-l\fR \fILANG\fR] [\fB\-o\fR \fIOUTPUT\fR]
Run optical character recognition using Tesseract engine.
.TP
.B clean [\fB\-\-all\fR] [\fB\-\-stats\fR]
Manage and clean SQLite local state database, bookmarks, and staging caches.
.TP
.B completions \fISHELL\fR
Generate shell completion scripts (bash, zsh, fish, powershell).
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
Open interactive terminal viewer:
.RS
.B noble-pdf open document.pdf
.RE
.PP
Inspect document structure in JSON:
.RS
.B noble-pdf \-\-json info report.pdf
.RE
.PP
Merge multiple documents:
.RS
.B noble-pdf merge ch1.pdf ch2.pdf ch3.pdf \-o complete_book.pdf
.RE
.PP
Extract text from odd pages to standard output:
.RS
.B noble-pdf text document.pdf \-p odd
.RE
